Sandbox stand-in answers as HackiOS's: container path from CFFIXED_USER_HOME, everything else allowed.

all25: the rebuilt LaunchServices database holds no PlugInKit extension (only one ExtensionKit
appex): no wallpaper provider is ever launched. Our stand-in failed sandbox extension issue/consume
(5/6) and "container expected" (0x43) with ENOENT and container path (4) too; HackiOS's
kern_minimac.c allows them all and answers 4 from CFFIXED_USER_HOME (pkd will not run an
extension without a container). sweetlsreset=2 moves the stores to .bak2 for one more rebuild,
leaving the first backup.

