+ * Request 4, "container path of a process" (sandbox_container_path_for_pid / _for_audit_token),
+ * as HackiOS's kern_minimac.c answers it: whoever starts a contained program (RunningBoard an
+ * application, pkd an extension) passes the container from containermanagerd as
+ * CFFIXED_USER_HOME, so it is read from the strings exec left at the top of the process's stack.
+ * PlugInKit does not run an extension without one ("plugin has invalid sandbox or container").
+ * A process without the variable gets success and an untouched buffer.
